  "version": "0.4.0",
  "notes": "### Added\n- Ask Pyxida can use Apple's on-device model on supported Macs without an API key. Your existing provider remains selected until you change it.\n- Ask Pyxida better handles short requests, Greeklish, and references to the open or last changed item. Settings warns when an OpenAI nano model is selected; new OpenAI setups start with a more capable mini model.\n\n### Fixed\n- Removing an attachment link no longer reports that file as unable to sync. If it stays unused for seven days, Pyxida moves it to recoverable History instead of permanently deleting it. Links in other notes or tasks keep the file.\n- Phone reminders show the task or meeting title and its start time in your app language. Tap one to open its details.\n- If a phone cannot read an older reminder, the notification asks you to open Pyxida instead of showing only \"Pyxida reminder\". Opening the app online repairs a missing reminder key and refreshes future reminders.",
